			{" "}
			<p>{"Please don’t harass him, "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/htmx_org/status/1756476449693872635">I draw energy</a>{" from his posts."}</p>
			{" "}
			<h2 id="drop-downs"><a class="zola-anchor" href="#drop-downs" aria-label="Anchor link for: drop-downs">Drop Downs</a></h2>
			{" "}
			<p>{"In July 2023, sparked by the accusation that htmx users could not create dropdowns, I did a deep-dive into web drop down technology and "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/htmx_org/status/1684936514885869568">uncovered a bombshell</a></p>
			{" "}
