			{" "}
			<p>{"A phrase I will often "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href={"https://x.com/search?q=htmx%20is%20a%20front%20end%20library%20of%20peace%20from%3A%40htmx_org&src=typed_query&f=live"}>quote tweet</a>{" violent htmx-related imagery with."}</p>
