			{" "}
			<p>{"In "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/htmx_org/status/1807183339222405317">June 2023</a>{", "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/srasash">&#64;srasash</a>{" accused htmx of being a government op, the first in many such increasingly ridiculous claims. I typically quote-tweet these claims and point out that "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href={"https://x.com/search?q=%22that%27s%20ridiculous%22%20from%3A%40htmx_org&src=typed_query&f=live"}>“that’s ridiculous”</a></p>
