			{" "}
			<p>{"The htmx & "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/intercoolerjs">intercooler.js</a>{" twitter accounts often fight with one another. Sometimes its just me "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/intercoolerjs/status/1859652045399355559">switching back and forth</a>, but two other people have access to the intercooler account, so sometimes I have no idea who I am fighting with.</p>
			{" "}
