			{" "}
			<p>{"I was very unfairly given "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/htmx_org/status/1719687461385691283">a lifetime ban</a>{" from "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.reddit.com/r/webdev/">/r/webdev/</a>{" for an "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://old.reddit.com/r/webdev/comments/17i0loi/anyone_heard_of_htmx/">obviously satirical post</a>{". Even the term “htmx” is banned (or semi-banned) on that sub, so people now use the "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://swag.htmx.org/products/htmeggs-shirt">htmeggs</a>{" instead."}</p>
